{"id":69819,"date":"2025-11-12T19:21:00","date_gmt":"2025-11-12T18:21:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=69819"},"modified":"2026-10-27T15:31:34","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T14:31:34","slug":"sao-silvestre-seide","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-seide\/","title":{"rendered":"8\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre de Seide 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">8\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre de Seide 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>8\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre de Seide 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no feriado de ter\u00e7a-feira, dia <strong>8 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, com partida e chegada no <strong>Parque da Freguesia de Seide S\u00e3o Miguel<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Braga<\/strong>). Integrada oficialmente no <strong>Circuito das S\u00e3o Silvestres de Famalic\u00e3o<\/strong> e no <strong>Circuito Jovem das S\u00e3o Silvestres de Famalic\u00e3o<\/strong>, esta emblem\u00e1tica prova minhota percorre as estradas asfaltadas da Uni\u00e3o de Freguesias de Seide, terra ligada \u00e0 mem\u00f3ria liter\u00e1ria de Camilo Castelo Branco, reunindo atletas federados, populares e fam\u00edlias numa tarde e in\u00edcio de noite de grande entusiasmo desportivo.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo arranca \u00e0 tarde com as provas gratuitas da <strong>Corrida Kids (500 m a 3.000 m)<\/strong> para os escal\u00f5es de Benjamins A (500 m), Benjamins B (500 m), Infantis (1.000 m), Iniciados (1.500 m) e Juvenis (3.000 m), culminando \u00e0s <strong>18:00<\/strong> com a <strong>Corrida Principal de 8 km<\/strong> e \u00e0s <strong>18:05<\/strong> com a <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong>. Todos os inscritos recebem t-shirt t\u00e9cnica de oferta, dorsal, seguro desportivo e medalha de participa\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0 chegada, contando a corrida de 8 km com abastecimento de \u00e1gua aos 4 km e na meta, pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios para o p\u00f3dio geral masculino e feminino (50 \u20ac, 30 \u20ac e 20 \u20ac), trof\u00e9us por escal\u00e3o e por equipas, bem como banhos quentes na sede do Agrupamento 463 do CNE em Seide S\u00e3o Miguel.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo da <strong>Uni\u00e3o de Freguesias de Seide<\/strong>, com a colabora\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Desporto e Aventura 365 Running Project<\/strong> e o apoio da C\u00e2mara Municipal de Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o (Corre Famalic\u00e3o), ADERE, GRUTACA, GRUCAMO e CNE Agrupamento 463.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">8 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Parque da Freguesia de Seide S\u00e3o Miguel, Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o, Braga<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-tra